00DB                  (            os9.d):01288         E$IBA               RMB       1                   Illegal Block Address
00DC                  (            os9.d):01289         E$HangUp            RMB       1                   Carrier Detect Lost
00DD                  (            os9.d):01290         E$MNF               RMB       1                   Module Not Found
00DE                  (            os9.d):01291                             RMB       1
