00E0                  (            os9.d):01293         E$IPrcID            RMB       1                   Illegal Process ID
     00E0             (            os9.d):01294         E$BPrcID            EQU       E$IPrcID            Bad Process ID (formerly #238)
00E1                  (            os9.d):01295                             RMB       1
00E2                  (            os9.d):01296         E$NoChld            RMB       1                   No Children
